@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@identifier = housekeeper.test@hanbay.local
@password = replace-with-local-housekeeper-password
@receptionistToken = replace-with-receptionist-jwt

### 1. Đăng nhập tài khoản Housekeeper
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{identifier}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("housekeeperToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Housekeeper xem trang đầu danh sách phòng cần dọn - kỳ vọng 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Kiểm tra phân trang tùy chỉnh - kỳ vọng 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Thiếu access token - kỳ vọng 401 AUTH_UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 5. Receptionist không có quyền - kỳ vọng 403 AUTH_FORBIDDEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Page âm - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=-1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Size bằng 0 - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=0&size=0
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Size vượt giới hạn - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=0&size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Page sai kiểu - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/dirty-rooms?page=abc&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Hoàn tất dọn phòng - kỳ vọng 200 và data.status = AVAILABLE
# Thay roomId bằng phòng hiện đang CLEANING.
@cleaningRoomId = replace-with-cleaning-room-uuid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/{{cleaningRoomId}}/complete-cleaning
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Hoàn tất lại phòng đã AVAILABLE - kỳ vọng 409 ROOM_CLEANING_COMPLETE_CONFLICT
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/{{cleaningRoomId}}/complete-cleaning
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Không có token khi hoàn tất dọn - kỳ vọng 401 AUTH_UNAUTHORIZED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/{{cleaningRoomId}}/complete-cleaning
Accept: application/json

### 13. Receptionist hoàn tất dọn - kỳ vọng 403 AUTH_FORBIDDEN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/{{cleaningRoomId}}/complete-cleaning
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Không tìm thấy phòng - kỳ vọng 404 ROOM_NOT_FOUND
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/complete-cleaning
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. roomId sai định dạng - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/housekeeping/rooms/not-a-uuid/complete-cleaning
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}
Accept: application/json
